{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the first two zones of UnderMine 2: The Goldmine and The Laboratories. As a lowly Devlemorian peasant, help Camilla reunite her workforce and get the mine back into smooth operation. In this demo, collect a limited number of relics and arcana to gain power and test yourself against UnderMine 2's first two bosses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITH A FRIEND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite your friend to drop in and play through the entirety of the demo together! Two-player co-op lets you tackle the game with each other, presenting a dynamic challenge and opening up new strategic options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CARRY OVER YOUR PROGRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a head start on Early Access and carry over your UnderMine 2 Demo progress using Cloud Saves. Any progress made in this demo will automatically transfer over to the EA release of UnderMine 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711960/extras/Campfire3_Half.gif?t=1748466720\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711960?t=1748466720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711960/06619ee327dd774bbe29cbb7d1f5489658366797/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748466720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711960/44fbe8c82d52a36e512638fda53dbc59a220cfcc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748466720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711960/44fbe8c82d52a36e512638fda53dbc59a220cfcc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748466720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/S